# Text files are stored and checked out with LF, on every platform. Without this, a Windows clone
# with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF in the working tree while CI gets LF, and anything that reads a
# line ending — a formatting check, a hash, a diff — disagrees with itself.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sln text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.snk binary
*.nupkg binary
